  <ADXVALUE id="TARGETIDLE" idhash="0x6E6545D8" title="Target Idle Speed">
    <desc>matched IP_N_SP_IS__TCO and IP_ACIN_N_SP_IS__TCO when compared to coolant temp&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;according to claude the ram address is 0xCE12-0xCE13&#013;&#010;</desc>
