  <ADXVALUE id="INJECTIONTIME1" idhash="0xC4FA143F" title="Injection Time Cylinder 1 ">
    <desc>the raw values for 0X27-0X36 appeared to be 8 closely matching words. Guessed that they might be injection time since ignition was settled and I couldnt think of any other values, assumed last 2 were per bank averages.&#013;&#010;Numbers seemed to make sense after applying this equation but unconfirmed. &#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;according to claude the ram address is 0xE1BC-0xE1BD</desc>
    <flags>0x00000002</flags>
    <parentcmdidhash>0xDAA83ACD</parentcmdidhash>
    <units>Injection Time Cylinder 1 (ms)</units>
    <packetoffset>0x27</packetoffset>
    <sizeinbits>16</sizeinbits>
    <range low="0.000000" high="30.000000" />
    <alarms low="0.000000" high="255.000000" />
    <digcount>2</digcount>
    <outputtype>3</outputtype>
    <datatype>52</datatype>
    <unittype>85</unittype>
    <MATH equation="0.004 * X">
      <VAR varID="X" type="native" />
    </MATH>
  </ADXVALUE>

