    <desc>nearly the same as 0x4A, likely the same value but for b1 isntead of b2&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;see Downstream O2 sensor heater duty Bank 1 for discription&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;according to claude the ram address is 0xE3D0</desc>
