  <ADXVALUE id="RAW_58" idhash="0xEF47DB86" title="0X58 Static 0?">
    <desc>Was 0 in all logs and never changed.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;according to claude its &quot;Quotient of a RAM word (E036) and rpm (F968), fed into ISA PWM lookups.&quot;&#013;&#010;its reads 0 because &quot;Start-transient path inactive&quot; &#013;&#010;ram address C3AC&#013;&#010;its confience level for this is low</desc>
    <flags>0x00000004</flags>
